Use the canonical browser-toolkit skills and the dedicated QA Chrome profile.
Inspect the product before changing code. Record accessibility, console,
network, screenshot, and performance evidence. Classify defects as
product-fix-required, capture-fixable, or informational. Never conceal product
defects or fabricate product UI/results. Fail closed to a readiness report when
demo gates do not pass.
